    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"ko\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; float:right; width: 23em; font-size:85%\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background:#6295DA; color:#FFFFFF; text-align:center;\"><big><big><b>닉스</b></big></big> <br /><span style=\"font-size:90%;\">Nix</span>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC:Nix_best_view-true_color.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Nix_best_view-true_color.jpg/250px-Nix_best_view-true_color.jpg?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Nix_best_view-true_color.jpg/500px-Nix_best_view-true_color.jpg?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"700\" data-file-height=\"700\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#6295DA; color:#ffffff; text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\">발견\n</th></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"nowrap\">발견자 </span>\n</th>\n<td>허블 우주 망원경 명왕성 위성조사팀\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"nowrap\">발견일 </span>\n</th>\n<td>2005년 6월 15일\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#6295DA; color:#ffffff; text-align:center;\" bgcolor=\"#EAEAEA\" colspan=\"2\">명칭\n</th></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/wiki/%EC%B2%9C%EB%AC%B8%ED%95%99%EC%9D%98_%EC%9E%84%EC%8B%9C_%EB%AA%85%EC%B9%AD#위성_및_고리\" title=\"천문학의 임시 명칭\">임시 이름</a> </span>\n</th>\n<td>S/2005 P2\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#6295DA; color:#ffffff; text-align:center;\" bgcolor=\"#EAEAEA\" colspan=\"3\">궤도 성질 <br />\n</th></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/wiki/%ED%96%89%EC%84%B1\" title=\"행성\">모행성</a> </span>\n</th>\n<td>명왕성\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"nowrap\">궤도 <a href=\"/wiki/%EA%B8%B4%EB%B0%98%EC%A7%80%EB%A6%84\" title=\"긴반지름\">긴반지름</a>(a) </span>\n</th>\n<td>48694 ± 3 km\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/wiki/%EA%B3%B5%EC%A0%84_%EC%A3%BC%EA%B8%B0\" title=\"공전 주기\">공전 주기</a>(P) </span>\n</th>\n<td>24.85463 ± 0.00003 일\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/wiki/%EA%B6%A4%EB%8F%84_%EA%B2%BD%EC%82%AC\" title=\"궤도 경사\">궤도 경사</a>(i) </span>\n</th>\n<td>0.133°±0.008°\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/wiki/%EA%B6%A4%EB%8F%84_%EC%9D%B4%EC%8B%AC%EB%A5%A0\" title=\"궤도 이심률\">궤도 이심률</a>(e) </span>\n</th>\n<td>0.00000\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#6295DA; color:#ffffff; text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\">물리적 성질\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/wiki/%EB%B0%98%EC%A7%80%EB%A6%84\" title=\"반지름\">반지름</a> </span>\n</th>\n<td>26.5×20.5×18 km\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/wiki/%EC%A7%88%EB%9F%89\" title=\"질량\">질량</a> </span>\n</th>\n<td>(4.5±4.0) ×10<span style=\"display:none\">^</span><sup>16</sup>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/wiki/%EB%B0%98%EC%82%AC%EC%9C%A8\" title=\"반사율\">반사율</a> </span>\n</th>\n<td>0.43 ~ 0.50\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"nowrap\">자전 주기 </span>\n</th>\n<td>혼란적\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/wiki/%EA%B2%89%EB%B3%B4%EA%B8%B0%EB%93%B1%EA%B8%89\" title=\"겉보기등급\">겉보기등급</a> </span>\n</th>\n<td>23.38 ~ 23.7\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"nowrap\">평균 <a href=\"/wiki/%EC%98%A8%EB%8F%84\" title=\"온도\">온도</a> </span>\n</th>\n<td>33 ~ 55 K\n</td></tr>\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>닉스</b>(Nix) 혹은 <b>134340 명왕성 II</b>(<a href=\"/wiki/%EC%86%8C%ED%96%89%EC%84%B1%EB%AA%85\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"소행성명\">소행성명</a> 134340 Pluto II)<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Nomenclature&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Nomenclature-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>는 <a href=\"/wiki/%EB%AA%85%EC%99%95%EC%84%B1\" title=\"명왕성\">명왕성</a>의 두 번째 위성이다. 2005년 5월에 <a href=\"/wiki/%ED%97%88%EB%B8%94_%EC%9A%B0%EC%A3%BC_%EB%A7%9D%EC%9B%90%EA%B2%BD\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"허블 우주 망원경\">허블 우주 망원경</a>으로 발견되었다. 발견 당시의 <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%EC%9E%84%EC%8B%9C%EB%AA%85%EC%B9%AD&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"임시명칭 (문서가 존재하지 않음)\">임시 명칭</a>은 <b>S/2005 P2</b>이었다. 닉스라는 이름은 그리스 신화의 밤의 여신 닉스에서 따온 것이다. 하지만 <a href=\"/wiki/%EC%86%8C%ED%96%89%EC%84%B1\" title=\"소행성\">소행성</a>의 이름으로 이미 <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=3908_%EB%8B%89%EC%8A%A4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"3908 닉스 (문서가 존재하지 않음)\">3908 닉스</a>(3908 Nyx)가 쓰이고 있어서 닉스(Nix)로 명명하였다.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"탐사\"><span id=\".ED.83.90.EC.82.AC\"></span>탐사</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%EB%8B%89%EC%8A%A4_(%EC%9C%84%EC%84%B1)&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"문단 편집: 탐사\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>편집</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%EB%8B%89%EC%8A%A4_(%EC%9C%84%EC%84%B1)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"문단의 원본 코드 편집: 탐사\"><span>원본 편집</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC:NixJuly11.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"2015년 7월 11일\"><img alt=\"2015년 7월 11일\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/NixJuly11.png/120px-NixJuly11.png?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/NixJuly11.png/250px-NixJuly11.png?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">2015년 7월 11일</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC:NH-Nix-LORRI-20150713.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"2015년 7월 13일\"><img alt=\"2015년 7월 13일\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/NH-Nix-LORRI-20150713.jpg/120px-NH-Nix-LORRI-20150713.jpg?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/NH-Nix-LORRI-20150713.jpg/250px-NH-Nix-LORRI-20150713.jpg?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1280\" data-file-height=\"720\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">2015년 7월 13일</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC:Nix_viewed_from_New_Horizons_2015-07-14.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"2015년 7월 14일\"><img alt=\"2015년 7월 14일\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Nix_viewed_from_New_Horizons_2015-07-14.jpg/120px-Nix_viewed_from_New_Horizons_2015-07-14.jpg?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/Nix_viewed_from_New_Horizons_2015-07-14.jpg/250px-Nix_viewed_from_New_Horizons_2015-07-14.jpg?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"325\" data-file-height=\"325\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">2015년 7월 14일</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC:Nix_released_11-09-2015.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"닉스 흑백 사진\"><img alt=\"닉스 흑백 사진\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Nix_released_11-09-2015.png/120px-Nix_released_11-09-2015.png?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"112\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/de/Nix_released_11-09-2015.png?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x\" data-file-width=\"197\" data-file-height=\"211\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">닉스 흑백 사진</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC:Nix_in_Color_Released_September_11_2015.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"닉스 컬러 사진\"><img alt=\"닉스 컬러 사진\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/Nix_in_Color_Released_September_11_2015.png/120px-Nix_in_Color_Released_September_11_2015.png?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"114\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/Nix_in_Color_Released_September_11_2015.png?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x\" data-file-width=\"206\" data-file-height=\"217\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">닉스 컬러 사진</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"각주\"><span id=\".EA.B0.81.EC.A3.BC\"></span>각주</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%EB%8B%89%EC%8A%A4_(%EC%9C%84%EC%84%B1)&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"문단 편집: 각주\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>편집</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%EB%8B%89%EC%8A%A4_(%EC%9C%84%EC%84%B1)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"문단의 원본 코드 편집: 각주\"><span>원본 편집</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Nomenclature-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-Nomenclature_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><cite class=\"citation web\">Jennifer Blue (2009년 11월 9일). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://planetarynames.wr.usgs.gov/append7.html#DwarfPlanets\" href=\"https://planetarynames.wr.usgs.gov/append7.html#DwarfPlanets\">&#8220;Gazetteer of Planetary Nomenclature&#8221;</a>. IAU Working Group for Planetary System Nomenclature (WGPSN)<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. 2010년 8월 30일에 확인함</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Gazetteer+of+Planetary+Nomenclature&amp;rft.pub=IAU+Working+Group+for+Planetary+System+Nomenclature+%28WGP